# 统一在仓库里存 LF，避免不同平台/API 推送造成整文件行尾差异
* text=auto

# 二进制资源，不做行尾与合并处理
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.pfx binary
*.bin binary

# PowerShell 脚本保持 CRLF（Windows PowerShell 5.1 最稳）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
